            "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>HOME SYSTEM<br>Lonely Island is provided as your private place. You can explore it, collect different building resources to improve your environment and buildings, attract businessman and open more advanced functions.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>THE WORLD<br>Our story happened in a land called Ground Hong with over 30 scenery including villages, towns, cities, islands, graves, ruins and mountains. Besides the main task, our branchy ones also support you have a wide knowledge of this world.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>BATTLE MODE<br>Our TBS system allows any arms, skills, buff and backup with 5V5 mode. Your speed decides your order, and you have to give a best tactics combination.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> TAME THE MONSTERS <br>Most of the monsters in the game can be tamed, and tamed monsters can be used as the guard to add attributes for the role. The guard will also have a chance to fight and unleash skills at the same time as the role is attacking. Tame the monster need to buy special props, &quot;Tame Token&quot; and use it in battle to wounded monster; </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>ATTRIBUTES<br>We provide many rare attributes for you. Use them properly will help you a lot.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Walkthrough<br>About walkthrough of our game, please click &quot;View the manual&quot; to see it at our store website page, or press &quot;LIBRARY&quot; - &quot;GAMES&quot; - &quot;Properties&quot; - &quot;GENERAL&quot;, then press &quot;Tales of Hongyuan manual&quot; on your steam application.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">ANY QUESTIONS/COMPLAINTS FOR ENGLISH PLEASE <u><a href=\"mailto:hoogyuan@gmail.com\">hoogyuan@gmail.com</a></u></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Hey guys!! FOLLOW US Twitter @Tales of Hongyuan</ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>HOME SYSTEM<br>Lonely Island is provided as your private place. You can explore it, collect different building resources to improve your environment and buildings, attract businessman and open more advanced functions.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>THE WORLD<br>Our story happened in a land called Ground Hong with over 30 scenery including villages, towns, cities, islands, graves, ruins and mountains. Besides the main task, our branchy ones also support you have a wide knowledge of this world.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>BATTLE MODE<br>Our TBS system allows any arms, skills, buff and backup with 5V5 mode. Your speed decides your order, and you have to give a best tactics combination.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> TAME THE MONSTERS <br>Most of the monsters in the game can be tamed, and tamed monsters can be used as the guard to add attributes for the role. The guard will also have a chance to fight and unleash skills at the same time as the role is attacking. Tame the monster need to buy special props, &quot;Tame Token&quot; and use it in battle to wounded monster; </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>ATTRIBUTES<br>We provide many rare attributes for you. Use them properly will help you a lot.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Walkthrough<br>About walkthrough of our game, please click &quot;View the manual&quot; to see it at our store website page, or press &quot;LIBRARY&quot; - &quot;GAMES&quot; - &quot;Properties&quot; - &quot;GENERAL&quot;, then press &quot;Tales of Hongyuan manual&quot; on your steam application.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">ANY QUESTIONS/COMPLAINTS FOR ENGLISH PLEASE <u><a href=\"mailto:hoogyuan@gmail.com\">hoogyuan@gmail.com</a></u></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Hey guys!! FOLLOW US Twitter @Tales of Hongyuan</ul>",
            "short_description": "As a Chinese RPG game, our story happened in a land called Ground Hong where you can experience wars between two kingdoms, make your friends and uncover a dust-laden history.",
