                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Shorter than current English-available CRPG on Steam but packs with good (and expected) CRPG's elements like fancy, eye-pleasing attacks, good story and not too obnoxious protagonist. English translation is much better than Tale of Wuxia series imo. Oh and it runs rather smooth on my toaster computer (on highest setting no less).\n\nBut Here are things I dislike: the difficulty spike at the beginning. Maybe I'm just bad and stupid but I ran into 2 wolves and barely get out alive; no auto-saves. I'm spoiled by auto-save games...; a bit grindy if you want your base to look like a 5 stars hotel. And I would love to see more side-quests which involve the playable characters more.\n\nOverall it's a great game for such a price. Definitely, recommend!\n\nPS: please bring more of your games to Steam, devs!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1514517391,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1514666983,
